[b]M-Reimu (禍霊夢)[/b]

A brand-new playable character has been added to Slay the Spire 2: M-Reimu. After lighting up the Doomstar by attacking enemies, she can unleash her finishing move to battle. She wields powerful cards that often come with risks.

[b]Content[/b]
[list]
[*]1 new playable character
[*]86 new cards
[*]10 exclusive relics
[/list]

[b]Asset Sources[/b]
[list]
[*]Most art assets are created using AI
[*]Character models and sound effects sourced from 熄廃人氏
[/list]

[b]Roadmap[/b]
[list]
[*]More attack special effects
[/list]

[b]Log Uploader[/b]
[list]
[*]This mod integrates with Log Uploader to automatically report crashes and errors.
[*]Enable this feature in: [b]Main Menu → Mod Settings → Log Uploader[/b]
[*]Uploaded logs help the mod author identify and fix issues faster, improving mod quality for everyone.
[*]No personal information is collected — only game state data needed for debugging.
[/list]

[b]Feedback[/b]
Report issues on the [url=https://steamcommunity.com/app/2861570/workshop/]Steam Workshop[/url] page or open an issue on [url=https://github.com/Andr0idCat/huoreimu/issues]GitHub[/url].

